    "identifier": "chinoike-sanguine-sphere",
    "description": "<p>You form a large 10-foot sphere of blood in front of you. You then move the sphere to a point within range and cause it to explode into shards of water.</p>\n<p>Each creature of your choice within 20 feet of the sphere when it explodes must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, creatures take 5d6 necrotic damage and gain 2 ranks of Bleed.</p>\n<p>Blood Detonation. Increase the size of the affected area by +10 feet and you can select up to 3 creatures to make unaffected by this jutsu’s effects.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu</p>\n<p>above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the</p>\n<p>damage by 1d6.</p>",
